.Sh NAME
.Nm ls
.Nd list directory contents
.Sh SYNOPSIS
.Nm
.Op Fl a
.Op Ar file ...
.Sh DESCRIPTION
list filenames in a directory, sorted alphabetically.
.Sh OPTIONS
.Bl -tag -width Ds
.It Fl a
print all entries, including those starting with
.Dq \&. .
